  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Total compensation is 50,000 units x $25 = $1,250,000. Under ASC 718, using the straight-line method over the 3-year service period, Year 1 expense is $1,250,000 / 3 = $416,667. ASC 718 permits straight-line as a policy election even with graded vesting.
Wrong (B): $1,250,000 is the total compensation cost for all three years, not the Year 1 amount alone.
Wrong (C): $625,000 would imply a 2-year vesting period ($1,250,000 / 2), which does not match the 3-year service requirement.
Wrong (D): $312,500 would result from dividing by 4 years, but the vesting period is 3 years.$EXPL$
