Wrong (B): $3,000,000 incorrectly omits certain identifiable assets from the net asset calculation, understating net identifiable assets.
Wrong (C): $22,000,000 is the net identifiable assets figure, not goodwill; goodwill is the excess of the purchase price over this amount.
