Wrong (A): Whether an entity is publicly traded is irrelevant to VIE classification; the analysis focuses on whether equity at risk is sufficient to finance operations.
Wrong (C): Total asset size does not determine VIE status; ASC 810 evaluates the sufficiency of equity at risk relative to the entity''s financing needs.
